  "notes": [
    "-AR verb. Irregular in the present tense: the weak vowel \"i\" becomes stressed \"í\" in all singular forms and ellos (vacío, vacías, vacía, vacían). Nosotros/vosotros are regular (vaciamos).",
    "This accent pattern is the same as enviar → envío, and liar → lío.",
    "All other tenses follow regular -AR endings.",
    "Regular past participle: *vaciado*",
    "*Voy a vaciar el armario antes de la mudanza.* (I'm going to empty the wardrobe before the move.)",
    "*¿Has vaciado el lavavajillas?* (Have you emptied the dishwasher?)",
    "Related: vacío/a (adjective: empty), el vacío (noun: emptiness/vacuum)"
  ],
